Different Style:
###-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------###
Solution in Java:
class Solution {
    public int singleNumber(int[] nums) {
        for (int i = 0; i < nums.length; i++) {
            int count = 0;

            for (int j = 0; j < nums.length; j++) {
                if (nums[i] == nums[j]) {
                    count++;
                }
            }

            if (count == 1) {
                return nums[i];
            }
        }

        return 0;
    }
}

